# rooms.pdl - the rooms of rpg-space (BOOK 16.game/RPG-DUST-PETSLIKE-BOARD-DESIGN.md D3, D13). Every room is an "over" room: 16 x 16 cells of tile_px (24), no wall strip; what a cell is comes from the skin (ops/rpg_space.c), there are no SCENERY or DOOR rows.
# Each room is one page (desk) of the book maps/rpg-space. The SHIP (bridge, quarters, hold, engine) is a world of rooms joined by doors the pets walk through, painted with the sci-fi RPG Maker sheets; the bridge is the hub (3 doors), the others have one door back. The PLANET pages (region, area) are generated by dust_gen for the CURRENT planet (planets.pdl, state/look_ledger.txt).
# ROOM | id | name | floor_col | floor_row | over | cols | rows | tile_px | biome
