ROOM | quarters | Quarters | 0 | 0 | over | 16 | 16 | 24 | ship
ROOM | hold     | Hold     | 0 | 0 | over | 16 | 16 | 24 | ship
ROOM | engine   | Engine   | 0 | 0 | over | 16 | 16 | 24 | ship
